    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="188" width="420" height="220">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">v11 诊断</span>：official core 与 direct 实现逐项等价（SimMark 2,000/2,000、SemStamp 1,999/1,999）；根因是 Instructor prompt/pooling 兼容性，非算法错误</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">v12 身份</span>：从固定 C4 validation shard 审计出 12,612 个全新双系统身份；冻结 1,000+1,000+1,000+500</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">v13–v15 生成</span>：replacement-aware → bounded fallback → causal-prefix，三次按合同 Stop</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">v16 rescue</span>：明确披露的 post-hoc validation rescue，补足 1,000 条</p>
      </content>
